{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smith\u2019s Chronicles</strong> is a cozy blacksmithing life sim about forging tools, fulfilling requests, and rebuilding a quiet town through the art of craftsmanship. Step into the boots of a young smith returning to their hometown, Grandall, and help breathe life back into the village. Mine ore, gather resources, and manage your workshop as every item you craft strengthens bonds, restores prosperity, and opens new paths for the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627700/extras/a2783e18860ad9f7a5ffdd3766a18453.avif?t=1767450536\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a bustling crossroads of cultures, Grandall has fallen into decline as its people drifted away. With your skills honed at the academy, you\u2019ll forge essential tools, rebuild the village, and create a welcoming home for both townsfolk and refugees. Return Grandall to its former glory, one hammer strike at a time!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627700/extras/c91da69a3a92d4b279bb5b7ba46b5e06.avif?t=1767450536\" width=294 height=92 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627700/extras/81d9bd0e45df92142faf3c8ba2ffcec9.avif?t=1767450536\" width=585 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft a wide range of tools and weapons, from smelting ore to assembling fine equipment. Help townsfolk with their daily needs and rebuild the town with your craft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627700/extras/26ef6b462204851032c7f7ad01e0f47a.poster.avif?t=1767450536\" width=888 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627700/extras/26ef6b462204851032c7f7ad01e0f47a.webm?t=1767450536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627700/extras/26ef6b462204851032c7f7ad01e0f47a.mp4?t=1767450536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627700/extras/139b8199922834c1b872c2beb235368f.avif?t=1767450536\" width=585 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your own blacksmith shop: set up displays and manage inventory. Upgrade your store and decorate your storefront to attract more customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627700/extras/582734814cb05387b9d82e6f3f609a69.poster.avif?t=1767450536\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627700/extras/582734814cb05387b9d82e6f3f609a69.webm?t=1767450536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627700/extras/582734814cb05387b9d82e6f3f609a69.mp4?t=1767450536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627700/extras/fa0fbbc9eb3c9ff116bb0dac43a77fb1.avif?t=1767450536\" width=585 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine, hunt, cut down trees, forage, and fish. Discover new biomes, gather precious resources, and turn them into tools that help Grandall thrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627700/extras/d2671faa6e5c9cdde4d70b0e5d4c4bde.poster.avif?t=1767450536\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627700/extras/d2671faa6e5c9cdde4d70b0e5d4c4bde.webm?t=1767450536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627700/extras/d2671faa6e5c9cdde4d70b0e5d4c4bde.mp4?t=1767450536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627700/extras/984bd501d67e8464353794daadfd8d5e.avif?t=1767450536\" width=585 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge friendships, pursue romance, and discover unique tales from the many races that call Grandall home. Create a welcoming and safe place for refugees and migrants from many regions of the world. Every connection opens the door to new stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627700/extras/61abcdde647fe219be1ba7f9cda82ea8.poster.avif?t=1767450536\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627700/extras/61abcdde647fe219be1ba7f9cda82ea8.webm?t=1767450536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627700/extras/61abcdde647fe219be1ba7f9cda82ea8.mp4?t=1767450536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627700/extras/9bee2d30bb2fd02c46cb0204741ea0eb.avif?t=1767450536\" width=585 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete main story quests, daily requests, and special events. Earn gold, rare resources, and most importantly, deepen your relationships with the people of Grandall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627700/extras/88ff68a5de4c724b8cd6da047f5f84cd.poster.avif?t=1767450536\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627700/extras/88ff68a5de4c724b8cd6da047f5f84cd.webm?t=1767450536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627700/extras/88ff68a5de4c724b8cd6da047f5f84cd.mp4?t=1767450536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627700/extras/216a0da1d82f499a3aa6cdb181f334b4.avif?t=1767450536\" width=585 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your workshop, blacksmith shop, and your living space. Use crafted items as decorations and make your smithy truly feel like home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627700/extras/cb7895f7690e440b88d03aff4304d419.poster.avif?t=1767450536\" width=888 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627700/extras/cb7895f7690e440b88d03aff4304d419.webm?t=1767450536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627700/extras/cb7895f7690e440b88d03aff4304d419.mp4?t=1767450536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627700/extras/221b220584bab64c70140bf877508bc5.avif?t=1767450536\" width=585 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express yourself with extensive character customization, and show off your most stylish blacksmith!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627700/extras/8e394a77c0966ca0cf5cbf8f6be615e5.poster.avif?t=1767450536\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627700/extras/8e394a77c0966ca0cf5cbf8f6be615e5.webm?t=1767450536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627700/extras/8e394a77c0966ca0cf5cbf8f6be615e5.mp4?t=1767450536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2627700?t=1767450536","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2627700?t=1767450536","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627700/576ccf4705bf60cd38258bd9f1e8c8e34715531e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767450536","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2627700/576ccf4705bf60cd38258bd9f1e8c8e34715531e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767450536","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <